    {
      "example_num": 1,
      "example_text": "Input: nums = [13,23,12]\nOutput: 4\nExplanation: We have the following: - The digit difference between 1 3 and 2 3 is 1. - The digit difference between 1 3 and 1 2 is 1. - The digit difference between 23 and 12 is 2. So the total sum of digit differences between all pairs of integers is 1 + 1 + 2 = 4 .",
      "images": []
    },
